rdinal":257709,"en":"He is a man fit to take the road;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l014","ordinal":257710,"en":"Gripping his spear and crushing the foe,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l015","ordinal":257711,"en":"He is a son fit to march with an army."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l016","ordinal":257712,"en":"When fire boils like hail,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l017","ordinal":257713,"en":"He is a son who can endure the embers."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l018","ordinal":257714,"en":"Though an army of six hundred thousand comes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l019","ordinal":257715,"en":"Surging forward without sparing life,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l020","ordinal":257716,"en":"He is a son who can withstand their bullets."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l021","ordinal":257717,"en":"When spears are leveled and men cry out,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l022","ordinal":257718,"en":"He is a son fit to face the massed host."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l023","ordinal":257719,"en":"Smashing all before him and clearing a path,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l024","ordinal":257720,"en":"He is a son upon whom one may rely."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l025","ordinal":257721,"en":"Stopping it and not letting it flow onward,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l026","ordinal":257722,"en":"He is a son fit to withstand a flood."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l027","ordinal":257723,"en":"Among all round-headed mortals,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l028","ordinal":257724,"en":"Could there be another champion like this?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l029","ordinal":257725,"en":"He is a mighty champion and a lion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l030","ordinal":257726,"en":"Would it be right to speak of him otherwise?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l031","ordinal":257727,"en":"His fierce courage is formidable indeed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l032","ordinal":257728,"en":"He is both a great lord and a lion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l033","ordinal":257729,"en":"He bowed eighty times before the idol;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l034","ordinal":257730,"en":"The time has come for him to become Chinese with us."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l035","ordinal":257731,"en":"The jeweled necklace of the warrior"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l036","ordinal":257732,"en":"Is one this son is worthy to wear;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l037","ordinal":257733,"en":"The many-tribed Chinese nation—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l038","ordinal":257734,"en":"Without bringing shame upon this people—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b003:l039","ordinal":257735,"en":"He is one who can govern them."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l001","ordinal":257736,"en":"In strength and heroism,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l002","ordinal":257737,"en":"He is a man complete in every way."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l003","ordinal":257738,"en":"If we raise him as khan over the Khaganate,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l004","ordinal":257739,"en":"How could Kongurbay compare with him?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l005","ordinal":257740,"en":"He is like a shower of steel bullets;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l006","ordinal":257741,"en":"There is none like him even in hell!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l007","ordinal":257742,"en":"So they raised an uproar,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l008","ordinal":257743,"en":"And the judges put him to the test."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l009","ordinal":257744,"en":"The multitude of Chinese khagans"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l010","ordinal":257745,"en":"Rejoiced greatly and clamored."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l011","ordinal":257746,"en":"“This is the heir of khans,” they said,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l012","ordinal":257747,"en":"“The master of Eselek,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l013","ordinal":257748,"en":"The lord of this Beijing.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l014","ordinal":257749,"en":"Driven wild with joy,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l015","ordinal":257750,"en":"They rang the bells with all their might;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l016","ordinal":257751,"en":"The people of forty khanates seethed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l017","ordinal":257752,"en":"And closed in with mighty shouts."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l018","ordinal":257753,"en":"Drinking spirits and holding a feast,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l019","ordinal":257754,"en":"The heroes gathered in boundless numbers."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l020","ordinal":257755,"en":"“A kinsman has come from the Kyrgyz,” they said,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l021","ordinal":257756,"en":"“God has given him to us.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l022","ordinal":257757,"en":"They bound upright with ropes"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l023","ordinal":257758,"en":"An enormous idol as large as a house,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l024","ordinal":257759,"en":"And staged an extraordinary spectacle"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l025","ordinal":257760,"en":"In the midst of the army."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l026","ordinal":257761,"en":"They brought forth ninety kinds"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l027","ordinal":257762,"en":"Of parrot-tail feathers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l028","ordinal":257763,"en":"And had them splendidly set"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l029","ordinal":257764,"en":"Upon the crest of his armor."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l030","ordinal":257765,"en":"They sent word to the Khagan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l031","ordinal":257766,"en":"Adorning it with magpie-tail feathers:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l032","ordinal":257767,"en":"“Külchoro is needed as khan,”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l033","ordinal":257768,"en":"And had these splendid things brought."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l034","ordinal":257769,"en":"The standards dipped and clamor filled the air;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l035","ordinal":257770,"en":"The people cried out and made their plans."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l036","ordinal":257771,"en":"All beneath the vault of heaven"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l037","ordinal":257772,"en":"Held a feast to make Külchoro khan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l038","ordinal":257773,"en":"They purified him and robed him in ceremonial dress,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0936:b004:l039","ordinal":257774,"en":"Then into a great pavilion with golden poles and copper ropes—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l001","ordinal":257775,"en":"They led him inside."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l002","ordinal":257776,"en":"The heroes and lions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l003","ordinal":257777,"en":"They roused into a frenzy;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l004","ordinal":257778,"en":"They made the longing old men"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l005","ordinal":257779,"en":"Dance at the celebration."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l006","ordinal":257780,"en":"They raised an unceasing tumult,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l007","ordinal":257781,"en":"A royal commotion of frantic haste;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l008","ordinal":257782,"en":"Holding such a feast for the warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l009","ordinal":257783,"en":"The gathered people stood there."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l010","ordinal":257784,"en":"The strongmen surged and pressed together,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l011","ordinal":257785,"en":"The great drum thundered loudly;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l012","ordinal":257786,"en":"The multitude of excited nobles"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l013","ordinal":257787,"en":"Honored him amid a roaring commotion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l014","ordinal":257788,"en":"As the people stood thus,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l015","ordinal":257789,"en":"Broad-jawed and eloquent,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l016","ordinal":257790,"en":"The unerring lion-warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l017","ordinal":257791,"en":"Whose smile made the sun rise,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0937:b003:l018","ordinal":257792,"en":"Whose face glowed red as the sun,"}]
